# Cloudflare Pages headers for the tile site (copied to the site's root as _headers by the workflows).
# Any web page may read the tiles (open data); archives are fetched whole (Pages answers Range requests with the whole
# file, docs/world-imagery-plan.md) and change rarely, so browsers may keep them a week.
/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Access-Control-Expose-Headers: Content-Length, ETag
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/world/t0/*.bin
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/world/t1/shards/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
